#X msg 110 756 @aalength;
#X text 245 756 Получить/Установить pitch transposer anti-alias filter
length. Тип: int. Значение по умолчанию: 64\. Диапазон: 8\...128\.;
#X msg 110 813 @antialias;
#X text 245 813 Получить/Установить use of anti-alias filter. Anti-alias
filter is used to prevent folding of high frequencies when transposing
the sample rate with interpolation. Тип: bool. Значение по умолчанию:
0\.;
#X msg 110 885 @dest;
#X text 245 885 Получить/Установить destination array. Тип: symbol.;
#X msg 110 915 @overlap;
#X text 245 915 Получить/Установить Overlap length in milliseconds.
When the chopped sound sequences are mixed back together \, to form
a continuous sound stream \, this parameter defines over how long period
the two consecutive sequences are let to overlap each other. Increasing
this value increases computational burden & vice versa. Тип: int. Единицы:
'ms'. Значение по умолчанию: 8\. Диапазон: 0\...100\.;
#X msg 110 1033 @pitch;
#X text 245 1033 Получить/Установить relative pitch change while keeping
the original tempo. Тип: float. Единицы: 'semitone'. Значение по умолчанию:
0\.;
#X msg 110 1090 @rate;
#X text 245 1090 Получить/Установить playback rate - changes both tempo
and pitch together as if a vinyl disc was played at different RPM rate.
Тип: float. Значение по умолчанию: 1\. Диапазон: 0.1\...2\.;
#X msg 110 1162 @seekwindow;
#X text 245 1162 Получить/Установить Seeking window default length
in milliseconds for algorithm that finds the best possible overlapping
location. This determines from how wide window the algorithm may look
for an optimal joining location when mixing the sound sequences back
together. The bigger this window setting is \, the higher the possibility
to find a better mixing position will become \, but at the same time
large values may cause a "drifting" artifact because consequent sequences
will be taken at more uneven intervals. If there's a disturbing artifact
that sounds as if a constant frequency was drifting around \, try reducing
this setting. Increasing this value increases computational burden
& vice versa. Giving *0* value for the seek window length sets automatic
parameter value according to tempo setting (recommended). Тип: int.
Единицы: 'ms'. Значение по умолчанию: 0\. Диапазон: 0\...100\.;
#X msg 110 1415 @sequence;
#X text 245 1415 Получить/Установить Default length of a single processing
sequence \, in milliseconds. This determines to how long sequences
the original sound is chopped in the time-stretch algorithm. The larger
this value is \, the lesser sequences are used in processing. In principle
a bigger value sounds better when slowing down tempo \, but worse when
increasing tempo and vice versa. Increasing this value reduces computational
burden & vice versa. Giving *0* value for the sequence length sets
automatic parameter value according to tempo setting (recommended).
Тип: int. Единицы: 'ms'. Значение по умолчанию: 0\. Диапазон: 0\...100\.;
#X msg 110 1593 @speech;
#X text 245 1593 Получить/Установить optimize for speech sound source.
Тип: bool. Значение по умолчанию: 0\.;
#X msg 110 1635 @src;
#X text 245 1635 Получить/Установить source array. Тип: symbol.;
#X msg 110 1665 @tempo;
#X text 245 1665 Получить/Установить relative tempo change without
affecting the sound pitch. Тип: float. Единицы: '%'. Значение по умолчанию:
0\. Диапазон: -50\...100\.;
